coder v0.0.0-devel

USAGE:
  coder identity [flags]

  Show the workload identity of the workspace daemon this command runs under

  The workload identity is who Coder considers this workspace daemon to be. It
  is separate from the user a human logs in as, and is always associated with
  the workspace owner.

OPTIONS:
  -o, --output text|json (default: text)
          Output format.

———
Run `coder --help` for a list of global options.
